Z||000000||jch82||04-14-2001||12:03 PM||||This has been really bugging me lately! I know there is a difference between backlight and offset on the gauges but which one does what??? I have an 85GT, is this offset or backlight? Thanks<P>Josh  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Yeah, my girlfriend takes collect calls from the road<BR>And it doesn't seem to matter that I'm lacking in the bulge<BR>She laughs at my dumb jokes when no one does<BR>She brings me mexican food from Sombrero's just because<BR>                 <I>-Blink 182</I>||||reg||5
Z||000001||grinthock||04-14-2001||06:25 PM||||<BR>Offset in 85, my 87 is backlit, if it's only a 140klm (sorry do'nt know US is that 80?) Speedo then it's OFFSET if it's a 180klm speedo then it's BACKLIT<P> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by jch82:<BR><B>This has been really bugging me lately! I know there is a difference between backlight and offset on the gauges but which one does what??? I have an 85GT, is this offset or backlight? Thanks<P>Josh   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>||||reg||10
